# Claude Code's working notes. Kept on disk, never published: DECISIONS.md is a
# log of how this repo argues with itself, which is useful to whoever is working
# on it and is not part of what the repo offers the world.
DECISIONS.md
.claude/

# The design system is NOT ignored: assets/preprint/ is a vendored, committed
# copy, so the site builds and deploys with no dependency on ~/code/preprint
# being present. `tools/sync-preprint` re-copies it, and `tools/push` in the
# system does every consumer at once.
.DS_Store

# The band crawler's working files: fetched elevation tiles (cached across
# Actions runs by actions/cache, not by git), the npm install it needs, and
# the one-line summary it writes for its own commit message. What the
# crawler PUBLISHES — eclipse-recon/data/ — is committed, on purpose.
.dem-cache/
node_modules/
.crawl-summary.txt

# The dictionary survey's downloads. Same arrangement as the crawler above: the
# four word lists are somebody else's to distribute and are only ever input, so
# they stay out; what the survey PUBLISHES — abecedarian/data/ — is committed,
# and tools/abecedarian-corpus.mjs re-fetches into here when the cache is cold.
.dict-cache/

# JPL kernels the eclipse tools download; they live in ~/.skyfield-data
*.bsp

# Scratch pages used to prototype or probe; never part of the site
_*.html
